    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shuruka Boxing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the ring and experience the most <strong>realistic first-person boxing simulation</strong> ever created. <strong>Shuruka Boxing</strong> puts you in the gloves of a rising champion, fighting your way to the top in brutal, high-stakes matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Hyper-Realistic Combat</strong> \u2013 Every punch, dodge, and block feels <strong>authentic</strong>, thanks to advanced physics and motion-captured animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Dynamic AI Opponents</strong> \u2013 Face off against fighters with unique styles, adaptive strategies, and brutal finishing moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to become the undisputed champion?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shuruka Boxing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the ring and experience the most <strong>realistic first-person boxing simulation</strong> ever created. <strong>Shuruka Boxing</strong> puts you in the gloves of a rising champion, fighting your way to the top in brutal, high-stakes matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Hyper-Realistic Combat</strong> \u2013 Every punch, dodge, and block feels <strong>authentic</strong>, thanks to advanced physics and motion-captured animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Dynamic AI Opponents</strong> \u2013 Face off against fighters with unique styles, adaptive strategies, and brutal finishing moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to become the undisputed champion?</p>",
    "short_description": "Shuruka Boxing - Experience the most realistic first-person boxing game ever! Dodge, block, and throw powerful punches in intense fights against dynamic AI or real players. Train, rise through the ranks, and become the undisputed champion. Do you have what it takes to win?",
